# Wave T29 (Lilac kit): bronzroof — Lilac City's own roof kind.
# OLIVE-BRONZE SHINGLE courses: staggered bronze shingles (8px
# shingles, half-offset every course), deep shade line closing
# each course, a dark ridge cap along the top. In the
# KIT_VARIANTS mauville roof tones (#98913f / #605c22 / #bab45e,
# log #7a6a3a). Structurally staggered shingle courses, not a
# recolour: Fairhaven wears stitched canvas sheets, Mistford
# vertical-split wood shakes, Copperton wide slabs with copper
# seams, Meadowbrook small staggered STONE courses (sage, no
# ridge cap, no bronze). The shingle stagger + ridge cap read
# at screenshot scale.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T29-LILAC-PLAN.md.)
